<p class="eyebrow">Our standard</p><h1>Methodology</h1><p class="lead">Zion turns public information into traceable real-estate research.</p><section><h2>Evidence before insight</h2><ol><li>Identify public records and primary sources.</li><li>Extract relevant property, development, and company facts.</li><li>Validate each fact and record its source, access date, and confidence.</li><li>Publish verified information separately from analytical estimates.</li></ol></section><section><h2>Data standard</h2><p>Every published claim should be traceable to an accessible source. Estimates and underwriting assumptions are clearly labelled and never presented as verified facts.</p></section>
